Here's the complete end to end architecture of everything Beacon is building.



---

## What Beacon is

A predictive dependency health monitoring platform. Engineering teams connect their GitHub repos once. Beacon scans every package, scores each one 0–100 using machine learning, predicts which ones will be abandoned 60–90 days before it happens, and alerts the team before it becomes a production incident.

