### Alert service — after scoring

```
7. Node.js receives POST /api/internal/score-complete

   alert.service.ts checkAndFireAlert():

   prev_sps = null → SKIP (first scan, never alert)

   On subsequent scans:
   prev_sps = 65, new_sps = 34

   Check conditions:
   → threshold crossed? 34 < 40 AND 65 >= 40 → YES
   → tier worsened? Watch → Critical → YES
   → tier improved? NO

   Dedup check:
   GET alert:dedup:threshold:{install_id}:{pkg_id}
   → missing → proceed
   SET alert:dedup:threshold:... EX 86400

   Write records:
   INSERT INTO alerts (sps_before=65, sps_after=34,
     tier_before='watch', tier_after='critical',
     ai_reason=..., alert_type='threshold')

   INSERT INTO notifications (
     message="Your moment package is about to expire.",
     tier='critical',
     action_url='/packages/{id}'
   )
   → Appears in bell feed immediately

   Dispatch channels (Promise.allSettled):
   → Slack Block Kit POST (if configured)
   → Google Chat Card V2 POST (if configured)
   → Immediate email via Resend (if configured)
```

