## Plan limits and repo scope

```
Plan enforcement (backend/src/lib/planLimits.ts):
  Starter (free): 1 monitored repo
  Pro:            5 monitored repos

Enforcement points:
  PATCH /api/repos/selected — rejects over limit
  GET /api/repos — returns repoLimit, monitoredCount
  GET /api/dashboard, /api/packages, /api/alerts — filtered to selectedRepos only
  signal-collect worker — scans selected repos only (no fallback to all granted)
  GitHub push webhook — rescan only if repo ∈ selectedRepos

Downgrade (Razorpay webhook): selectedReposTrim.service trims excess repos
```

