## Package deduplication (multi-user)

```
packages table: UNIQUE (name, ecosystem)
  → Same npm package scanned by two orgs shares one Package row
  → package_signals attach to packageId (global signal snapshot)
  → repo_packages links each user's repo to shared package

Implication:
  Re-scan by any user refreshes signals for everyone using that package
  Future: stale-signal refresh policy + upstream repo resolution per package
```

