### Recommended build order

```
1. Run Python intelligence worker → score-complete (unblocks SPS, tiers, alerts)
2. Persist recommendations in score-complete + return on GET /api/packages/:id
3. Expose predictionReason to FE; wire package alert history to API
4. Wire integrations page to backend /api/integrations (save + test)
5. Upstream repo resolution + real funding/OSSF APIs
6. CVE advisory path + supply-chain alert type
```

---

That is the complete architecture. Three services, two queues, one database, one cache. Everything else is functions and cron jobs inside those three services.